Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:16.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:16.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:20.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I realize that you didn't expect to walk in and see that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:20.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你不想进来看到这个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me explain, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我解释好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We weren't doing anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, he just saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  他看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But what you saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你所看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that is the extent of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是全部了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:34.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:34.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}仅仅一个吻而已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:36.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, come on. That's a lie! We also kissed in Barbados.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:36.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  你说谎我们在巴巴多斯就吻过了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dude, chill!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哥们儿  闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:42.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, we also kissed in Barbados...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:42.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我们在巴巴多斯也吻过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:43.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but we didn't plan it. Ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:43.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可我们没想那样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:45.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only reason that that happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:45.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生这件事的唯一原因
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...was because I saw you kiss Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我看见你吻查莉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:50.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you started it!  I have got to chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:50.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  是你开始的  我真的该闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:54.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, we probably should
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:54.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我们或许应该
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}have talked to you about this before it ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在事情发生之前跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:00:59.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:00:59.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, we feel so terrible about this, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们也感到非常抱歉  罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. But it did happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是  可它确实发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.82,0:01:07.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.82,0:01:07.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.97,0:01:22.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.97,0:01:22.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.66,0:01:28.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can we just close the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.66,0:01:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干脆把门关了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.06,0:01:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S10E02 The One Where Ross Is Fine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.06,0:01:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第十季  第2集 罗斯不难过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:09.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:09.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  说点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:10.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:10.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:14.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you two are...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:14.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以说你们俩...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:17.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:17.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是  -是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:20.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And have you had...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你们有没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:21.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No... - No...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:21.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没...  -没...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if I hadn't walked in here, would you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可如果我没进来的话  你们会不会...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:28.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Probably--No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:28.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许...不  不会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:32.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, this is not how we wanted you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:32.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  我们本来没想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:33.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to find out about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:33.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你以这种方式发现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have every right to go nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有权利抓狂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not going nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会抓狂的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you see me going nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看我抓狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:40.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:40.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  可你知道我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:47.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you two are happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:47.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们俩开心...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我也会为你们开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:53.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:53.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:57.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:57.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的  -当然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.06,0:03:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.06,0:03:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:03.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know why it's coming out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:03.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.69,0:03:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}all loud and squeaky...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.69,0:03:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的声音又大又尖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because, really, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过说真的  我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:14.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not saying I wasn't a little surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:14.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是说看见你们接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to see you guys kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点也不吃惊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:19.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, at first I was like:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:19.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说  开始我有点...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:25.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But now that I've had time to absorb it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:25.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过现在  给我时间消化了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Loving this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:33.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ross. - It's all working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:33.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-罗斯  -都解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me and Charlie. And you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和查莉  还有你们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:39.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:39.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道我们应该干什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.71,0:03:41.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Calm ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.71,0:03:41.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:46.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should all have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:46.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该一起吃顿饭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, we'll do it tomorrow night. I'll cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我们明天晚上就吃  我来掌勺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, don't you think that would be a little weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得那样太怪了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Weird? What? What's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怪  为什么  哪儿怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:58.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only thing weird would be if someone didn't like Mexican food...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:58.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果有人不喜欢墨西哥菜才是怪事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:03:59.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because I'm making fajitas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:03:59.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我会做法加它（一种墨西哥食物）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do like fajitas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我非常喜欢法加它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:14.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, this adoption stuff is so overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:14.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天呐  领养怎么这么多事儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:18.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's inter-country adoption, dependency adoption.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:18.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有跨国领养  从属领养...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:20.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's so many ways to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:20.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有这么多方法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:22.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and this is, like, the biggest decision of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:22.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就像我们一生中最大的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:24.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a hair in my coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:24.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我咖啡里有根头发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:27.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:27.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:29.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you seen Frank Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:29.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看见小弗兰克了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:31.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's meeting me here with the triplets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:31.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要带着三胞胎来看我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:33.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's funny, every time you say "triplets" ...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:33.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太有意思了  每次你说"三胞胎"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:36.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...l think of three hot, blond 19-year-olds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:36.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我马上就想到三个火辣的19岁金发女郎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真有爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.93,0:04:40.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Drink your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.93,0:04:40.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喝你的头发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:43.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, what's all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:43.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这都是啥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.43,0:04:46.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're brochures from different adoption agencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.43,0:04:46.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些是我们从不同的领养中心找来的小册子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Babies! Oh, this one is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小孩子  这个好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就要这个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:53.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not really how it works.
